## Secure Implementation

### Tier 1: Critical Fix (2 min)

**Disable H2 console in production**

```java
// SECURE: H2 console disabled in application.properties
# application.properties (production)
spring.h2.console.enabled=false

# application-dev.properties (local development only)
spring.h2.console.enabled=true
spring.h2.console.path=/h2-console
spring.h2.console.settings.web-allow-others=false  # Localhost only
```

### Tier 2: Essential Defenses (15 min)

**Use production database and secure H2 for dev/test only**

```java
